+Local placement for basket evidence:
+
+`actor_or_protocol_evidence`:
+
+- `/bin/id` result from `identity_and_auth` for customer ownership or employee
+  action-target branching.
+
+`action_targets`:
+
+- `/proc/baskets/<id>.json` when the basket is the requested target or a target
+  selected for a sibling workflow.
+
+`answer_records`:
+
+- The owned basket record when answering status, discount presence, latest
+  basket, or lifecycle questions.
+- Candidate owned basket records on true clarification outcomes.
+
+`considered_not_cited`:
+
+- Foreign baskets located for a customer cross-boundary denial.
+- Missing basket paths linked from archived payments when the surviving payment
+  snapshot, not a live basket, is the evidence.
+
+`refs_must_include`:
+
+- `/proc/baskets/<id>.json` only if ownership passed for a customer actor or it
+  is an employee action target.
+- Each owned candidate basket path on `OUTCOME_NONE_CLARIFICATION`.
+
+`refs_must_not_include`:
+
+- Foreign customer basket paths, rejected/ambiguous candidates the actor cannot
+  see, and docs read only as registry background.
+
+`post_state_records`:
+
+- none in this BP; sibling mutating BPs own basket post-state reads.
 
